4. Add a Note (optional) for our team.
5. Tick that you are responsible for the booking: the deductible ($2,500) and any damage, tickets, tolls and fees during it are billed to you, whoever drives, each with its evidence.
6. Press **Book my car**.

![](/guides/img/owner-04-calendar-desktop-a4500851.jpg "desktop; size: 450 570; address: carmacars.ca/owner/bookings; pins: 2 92.2 14.6, 3 92.2 64.9, 4 42.2 89.6")

